---
interface Props {
  tab: 'how-it-works' | 'sources';
}

const { tab } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="g ab">
  <h2>About this digest</h2>
  <p class="intro">
    Dan wanted one weekly read on AI across business, technical work, education and policy, without wading through
    dozens of feeds. So he picks the sources, and AI does the sorting and summarizing. This page explains how a week
    gets made and lists every source it reads.
  </p>
</div>
<nav class="tabs" aria-label="About">
  <a href="/about/how-it-works" aria-current={tab === 'how-it-works' ? 'page' : undefined}>How it works</a>
  <a href="/about/sources" aria-current={tab === 'sources' ? 'page' : undefined}>Sources</a>
</nav>
